    "enUS": {
      "description": "One of the letters on this table is encrypted and inscrutable.",
      "dialogue": {
        "259092da272dfc386aca": "Yes, $gsir:madam;?  Do you have some business with me?",
        "6e4d99062790c1a84b59": "What is this?  Hold a moment...let me take a closer look.$B$B...$B$BHm, I have never before seen this form of encryption, but I must admit that my knowledge in that area is by no means complete.",
        "869a58790447351df7eb": "Yes, $gsir:madam;?  Do you have some business with me?"
